      "releaseNotes": "# ownCloud Deployment Hub v1.0.0\n\n## What's New\n\n- Initial production release of the deployment hub\n- Support for Docker and Podman single-host deployments\n- Kubernetes (Helm) support at chart 0.7.0 / oCIS 7.1.4 (Community Preview)\n- Ansible wrapper for Docker and Podman\n- Complete sizing calculator with headroom\n- EULA acknowledgement with explicit No warranties and Limitation of liability\n\n## Known Limitations\n\n- Kubernetes/Helm is Community Preview only (issue #6)\n- Podman is Community Preview until rootless evidence passes\n- K3s is evaluation-only\n\n## Upgrade Notes\n\nThis is the first production release. No upgrade path from previous versions.",
